IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTDECODE-V5.

DATA DIVISION.
01 BATCH-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 WARPS-PER-BLOCK     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPEC-DEPTH          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTDECODE-V5.
    IF BATCH-SIZE == 0 OR WARPS-PER-BLOCK == 0 OR SPEC-DEPTH == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 18900 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 BATCH-SIZE.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
